        "q": "How do I create a discount code?",
        "a": "Vouchers page (admin/manager). Choose a fixed € amount or a percentage, set a minimum spend, expiry and usage limit. The cashier applies it from the POS Vouchers button."
      },
      "users": {
        "q": "How do I add a cashier?",
        "a": "Users page → Add a user → choose the Staff role. Staff can only see the dashboard and the till."
      },
